    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The ActiveCampaign extension for AffiliateWP adds an opt-in checkbox to the affiliate signup page, enabling your affiliates to subscribe to your ActiveCampaign-powered newsletter.</p>\n<p>Site admins can also select whether to show the checkbox, or simply autoregister all new affiliates.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Activate the plugin</li>\n<li>Navigate to Affiliates-&gt;Settings-&gt;Integrations</li>\n<li>Enter your API information and select a list</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"none%20yet%21\">\nNone yet!\n</h4>\n<p></p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.3, February 3, 2026</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Tested up to WordPress 6.9</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2, December 16, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update author to DigitalME</li>\n<li>Add ympno as contributor</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1, October 5, 2017</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Update author info</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0, October 7, 2015</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First offical release!</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
